seed 302
use binding
register web-1.0 pins 2 edition "2026-10" lease 8d use by-text

grant
  grant call web::q to web

register web-1.1 pins 2 edition "2026-10" lease 8d use by-text
register web-2.0 pins 2 edition "2026-10" lease 8d use by-int

as web call web-1.1 1
  "x"
----

as web call web-2.0 error Denied { detail: "role `web` may call nothing in bundle web-2.0" }

query
  from a in catalog::audit.Denied where a.role == "web" select a.origin
----
Registered { bundle: "web-2.0", query: 0 }
